# offered the Black Lotus in its graveyard, which stays there.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Deadly Brew
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
